{"unit_id":"Winter-And-You-Gone__dsh-deep-verbs#card-zh","repo":"Winter-And-You-Gone/dsh-deep-verbs","commit":"3af25c3ee634b2a65b4bdbb194db28b6e1040d41","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deep-verbs 是面向 DSH Web 的思考状态行文案插件。它通过浏览器端模块接入状态行，将内置的 “Deep diving...” 替换为英中双语短语。回合开始时从洗牌词池抽取短语；新思考或回答段、工具调用及模型重试到来时按至少 3 秒间隔轮换；点击状态行可切换当前短语语言并同步其他活动状态行。它适合希望自定义等待提示、让多会话界面保持一致的 DSH Web 用户。需在 DSH profile 注册插件，无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:42-55","client.js:237-260","client.js:308-337","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"Winter-And-You-Gone__dsh-deep-verbs#card-en","repo":"Winter-And-You-Gone/dsh-deep-verbs","commit":"3af25c3ee634b2a65b4bdbb194db28b6e1040d41","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-deep-verbs customizes the DSH Web thinking line with bilingual phrases. It picks one at turn start and rotates on response steps or tool calls, at least three seconds apart. Clicking switches languages and syncs active lines. Register it in a DSH profile; no key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:42-55","client.js:237-260","client.js:308-337","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
